232
00:11:18,830 --> 00:11:21,830
And just before the
deadline I got the paper in.

233
00:11:21,830 --> 00:11:27,350
And so, I owe it to
that lady for submitting

234
00:11:27,350 --> 00:11:28,670
to NeurIPS that year.

235
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:31,280
But yeah, anyway, I think the
crazy thing about transformers

236
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:33,740
was that it all came together
in like three months.

237
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:35,870
Most of the ideas
happened in that span.

238
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:40,565
And it was just like this sprint
towards the NeurIPS deadline.

239
00:11:40,565 --> 00:11:42,815
I think a lot of the other
members on the team, Jakab,

240
00:11:42,815 --> 00:11:45,710
Lukasz, Noam, Ashish, they
knew how important it was.

241
00:11:45,710 --> 00:11:48,200
But for me, I was
like, I don't know.

242
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:54,050
I really did not
