243
00:11:54,050 --> 00:11:55,550
But in retrospect,
it's been amazing

244
00:11:55,550 --> 00:12:01,110
how the community has kind of
come together and adopted it.

245
00:12:01,110 --> 00:12:03,470
And I think most of
that can be ascribed

246
00:12:03,470 --> 00:12:05,450
to the ease of optimization.

247
00:12:05,450 --> 00:12:08,630
It seems like very robust
to hyperparameter choices.

248
00:12:08,630 --> 00:12:11,240
So you don't need to tune
the hell out of it, spend

249
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:14,078
a lot of time tweaking
little things.

250
00:12:14,078 --> 00:12:15,620
And the other side
is that it's super

251
00:12:15,620 --> 00:12:19,700
tailored to the
