metrics and representation

392
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:44,880
learning in a similar fashion
to how we did it in NPTs.

393
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:48,792
However, these approaches are
usually limited, in some sense,

394
00:18:48,792 --> 00:18:50,000
in comparison to NPTs, right?

395
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:53,300
They're often kind of motivated
