400
00:19:00,390 --> 00:19:04,820
And so, we really think
NPTs present maybe

401
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:06,500
the most versatile
and most widely

402
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:09,230
applicable of these
non-parametric prediction

403
00:19:09,230 --> 00:19:10,020
approaches.

404
00:19:10,020 --> 00:19:12,050
That's something we
explicitly wanted to have.

405
00:19:12,050 --> 00:19:14,720
We wanted to have something
that's really easy to use, plug

406
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,700
