1065
00:47:12,682 --> 00:47:14,140
You're going to be
back propagating

1066
00:47:14,140 --> 00:47:16,600
a loss on the ones that are
masked, of course, because you

1067
00:47:16,600 --> 00:47:19,120
don't want your model to
have those available at input

1068
00:47:19,120 --> 00:47:22,390
if you're going to actually try
